title Home Assistant: the dashboard's Favourites: tiles with icons and state colours (a dimmable light on with its slider row, a light off, a lock locked, a temperature, a thermostat heating, a scene, an unavailable light, a garage door), the tab bar with the connection; dragged to the end
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
shot favourites
check favourites
expect text "Online"
expect text "Favourites"
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect text "On, 72 %"
expect text "72 %"
expect text "Reading lamp"
expect text "Off"
@800x480,1024x600,1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "Locked"
@1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "21.5 °C"
@1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "Heat, 21.4 °C"
@1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "Unavailable"
@1280x720,1280x800,800x1280 expect text "Closed"
# a drag scrolls the grid (no tile acts)
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
shot favourites-end
check favourites-end
expect text "Unavailable"
expect text "Closed"
expect text "Scene"
expect noquit
